                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "17e3d3e4-1dd1-3b53-9ffc-e3173d458f9b",
                        "entry_id": "f79a99ce-868c-33dc-a702-df0a81af1ca9",
                        "glosses": [
                            "To join a bandwagon (a current movement that attracts wide support)."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "figuratively"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "97137b98-c927-4e80-b1e1-aadd97653234",
                                "sense_id": "17e3d3e4-1dd1-3b53-9ffc-e3173d458f9b",
                                "text": "Again, only three years ago, he opposed every measure advocated by Woodrow Wilson—did all he could to prevent his nomination—and bandwagoned when the nomination could no longer be prevented."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ac11ded3-a0b2-4494-b76c-10451d016586",
                                "sense_id": "17e3d3e4-1dd1-3b53-9ffc-e3173d458f9b",
                                "text": "“Weeping Walter” is a notorious example of the theory that “trimming” pays in politix. He has blown with every wind; he has bandwagoned with every passing movement from the Ku Klux Klan to the Townsend plan; […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9876e5a7-68e8-48af-ab04-9fba75fe3503",
                                "sense_id": "17e3d3e4-1dd1-3b53-9ffc-e3173d458f9b",
                                "text": "The sell-out bandwagonned and, as Sam [Rayburn] continued to stall, a positive vote against seating the Virginia delegation turned into a positive vote for seating them."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "674b3899-4ce9-4b28-874d-b369f02c9fb5",
                                "sense_id": "17e3d3e4-1dd1-3b53-9ffc-e3173d458f9b",
                                "text": "Everyone in my school flew rebel flags and had rebel flag tattoos and I bandwagoned and got the tattoo."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
